Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 09:50:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] TDEHTML: add SVG image loading and rendering
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Load SVG resources through the normal TDEHTML image path.

Support intrinsic SVG dimensions, viewBox sizing and rasterization at the requested RenderImage size.

Signed-off-by: Sebastião Guerra <sebastiao.luiz.guerra@gmail.com>
---
